Source B — competing design preview: https://html.dppreview4client.com/berry/
Additional Source A pages are listed in the source register at the end. The competitor preview is a design reference, not an authoritative source of company facts.
Company identity and business
Source A identifies the business as Berry Alloys Limited, also styled Berry Alloys Ltd. Its CIN is U27310WB2006PLC145016. The business manufactures bulk ferro alloys for Indian and overseas markets. The product families are ferro manganese, silico manganese, ferro chrome and ferro silicon. The website highlights a facility in Vizianagaram, Andhra Pradesh, and export logistics through Visakhapatnam Harbour Port.
The current homepage announces a future corporate office at 56, Chowringhee Road, Kolkata 700071. It describes a 2.6 MW solar installation as part of efforts to lower emissions; completion and operating status need confirmation.
Current website page structure
Primary navigation covers the homepage, company profile, products, sustainability, community, news and media, careers, and contact details. Community links include CSR activities, CSR policy, annual returns using Form MGT 7, remuneration policy, vigil mechanism policy, and independent director appointment terms.
Homepage content progresses through a promotional carousel, company introduction, plant metrics, products, achievements, growth history, memberships and sponsorships, client logos, and office contacts. Carousel themes include the new Kolkata office, manufacturing and exports, solar energy, and environmental responsibility.
